      "markdown": "延伸拓展 求  $ S_{\\Delta MAD} =? $\n\n $ \\therefore \\frac{S_{\\Delta MAD}}{S_{\\Delta MBC}} = (\\text{相似比})^{2} = (\\frac{4}{5})^{2} = \\frac{16}{25} $\n\n即  $ \\frac{S_{\\Delta MAD}}{S_{\\Delta MAD} + S_{\\Delta MBC}} = \\frac{16}{25} $\n\nBut.  $ S_{\\Delta MAD} =? $\n\n有的同学可能会说四边形ABCD为梯形\n\n $ = \\frac{1}{2}(AD + BC) \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times (8 + 10) \\times \\frac{1}{2} $\n\n $ = 9\\frac{1}{2} $\n\n但是. 高是多少呢？这就是问题所在！\n\n看我的！如图：作DQ∥AB，交BC于Q\n\n∵ AD∥BQ，AB∥DQ，∴ 四边形BQDA为平行四边形\n\n∴ BQ = AD = 8，∴ CQ = 2，DQ = BA = 4。\n\n在△DQC中，\n\n $ \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l} QD = 4 \\\\ QC = 2 \\\\ CD = 5 \\end{array}\\right. $\n\n那面积呢？",
